\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries up to 3 attempts when the server returns 503, with exponential backoff between them. I checked it against a local test server.\n\n- **Backoff:** it sleeps 0.5s after the first failure and 1.0s after the second, so there is no sleep after the last attempt. You can change this through new constructor arguments, `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`.\n- **Other errors:** a non-503 HTTP error is raised immediately with no retry. If all 3 attempts return 503, the last 503 error is raised.\n- **Not covered:** connection errors and timeouts are not retried, because you only asked about 503.\n\n**Test results** (script at `/tmp/smoke.py`, not added to the repo):\n\n| Server behaviour | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503 twice, then 200 | success | 3 |\n| 503 three times | 503 raised | 3 |\n| 500 | 500 raised | 1 |", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 69971, "requests_cache_write": 107475, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2912986, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1559, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial4", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 67, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:43:59.321837+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 16.124, "t_checker_s": 2.383, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1571, "tokens_cache_read": 69971, "tokens_cache_write": 107475, "tokens_fresh": 1571, "tokens_input_uncached": 1